<section>
  <h2>What affects the price of wedding security?</h2>
  <p>Your quote depends on the number and type of personnel, dates, total duty hours each day, number of entrances, venue layout, guest count, travel and any overnight cover. A one-day event still needs clearly agreed hours; “per day” does not automatically mean 24-hour duty.</p>
  <p>Request a written quote that states dates, staff count, reporting and finish times, supervisor contact, travel costs and any extra-hours terms. During busy dates, confirm availability before treating an enquiry as a booking.</p>
</section>

